## Why This Question Is Asked

This question evaluates a candidate's ability to model the economics of privacy-preserving data collaboration across financial institutions. It tests the capacity to balance data utility against privacy budgets while accounting for governance overhead and operational complexity.

## Key Concepts

- Differential privacy budgets and their impact on synthetic data fidelity
- Economic trade-offs in cross-organization data sharing
- Compliance, auditability, and governance cost modeling
- Phased rollout strategies with rollback and fallback mechanisms

## Code Example

```javascript
function computePrivacyBudget(epsilon, cohortSize, delta = 1e-5) {
  // Approximate (ε, δ)-DP budget allocation per cohort
  const epsPerCohort = epsilon / Math.sqrt(cohortSize);
  return { epsilon: epsPerCohort, delta, budgetExhausted: epsPerCohort < 0.01 };
}

function estimateFidelityLoss(privacySpend, baseFidelity) {
  // Fidelity degrades as more privacy budget is consumed
  return baseFidelity * Math.exp(-privacySpend);
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
This angle tests the ability to quantify a data-heavy feature with a clear offline-first constraint, balancing device resources against business value.

## Key Concepts
- Offline-first architectures
- Local indexing and delta synchronization
- Resource budgeting (CPU, memory, storage)
- Data transfer costs and break-even analysis

## Code Example
```
// Implementation sketch: simple local search index
class LocalIndex {
  constructor() { this.docs = []; }
  build(docs) { this.docs = docs.map(d => ({ id: d.id, text: d.content })); }
  search(q) {
    const terms = q.toLowerCase().split(/\s+/);
    return this.docs.filter(d => terms.every(t => d.text.toLowerCase().includes(t)));
  }
  deltaUpdate(changes) {
    // apply lightweight patches to docs
    changes.forEach(c => {
      const idx = this.docs.findIndex(d => d.id === c.id);
      if (idx >= 0) this.docs[idx] = { ...this.docs[idx], ...c.patch };
      else this.docs.push({ id: c.id, text: c.patch.content });
    });
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you implement delta-sync to minimize data transfer while ensuring consistency?
- What privacy controls would you layer to protect sensitive docs during offline usage?

